           <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;Decay function defines how light intensity decays with distance from the light. Decay function 1/r² complies with the laws of physics. 1/r reduces the decaying of light intensity. 1/r³ increases the decaying of light intensity. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
          </property>
          <item>
